    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://example.org/dpia-conditions#DPIARequiredList"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A process which requires a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of EX and which involves processing of personal video data when video surveillance is conducted in areas not owned by the controller or healthcare settings or combined with sound recordings</skos:definition>
