    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/dpv/legal/ro#DPIARequiredList"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A process which requires a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Romania and which involves the processing of children’s personal data for profiling or automated decision-making purposes or for marketing purposes, or for direct offering of services intended for them </skos:definition>
