    <impacto-old:hasReuseGap rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Both risks carry over. The FRIA adds ex:Risk-GroupDisadvantage, which concerns non-discrimination rather than data protection.</impacto-old:hasReuseGap>
